  "content": {
    "id": "p21-q12-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "The powers of 3 that are greater than 1 form a GP $3, 9, 27, \\ldots$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p21-q12-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find using logarithms how many powers of 3 there are between $2$ and $10^{20}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "41 powers of 3.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}2&<3^n<10^{20}\\\\\\log_{10}2&<n\\log_{10}3<20\\\\\\frac{\\log_{10}2}{\\log_{10}3}&<n<\\frac{20}{\\log_{10}3}\\\\0.631\\ldots&<n<41.918\\ldots\\end{aligned}$$\nThus $n=1,2,3,\\ldots,41$, giving 41 powers of 3.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q12-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Show that $S_n=\\frac{3}{2}(3^n-1)$, and find the smallest value of $n$ for which $S_n>10^{20}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$S_n=\\frac{3}{2}(3^n-1)$; smallest $n=42$.",
          "worked": "$a=3$ and $r=3$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}S_n&=\\frac{a(r^n-1)}{r-1}\\\\S_n&=\\frac{3(3^n-1)}{3-1}\\\\S_n&=\\frac{3(3^n-1)}{2}\\\\S_n&=\\frac{3}{2}(3^n-1)\\end{aligned}$$\nAs required. For $S_n>10^{20}$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2}(3^n-1)&>10^{20}\\\\3^n-1&>\\frac{2}{3}\\times10^{20}\\\\3^n&>\\frac{2}{3}\\times10^{20}+1\\\\n&>\\log_3\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\times10^{20}+1\\right)\\\\n&>41.549\\ldots\\end{aligned}$$\nTherefore the smallest value is $n=42$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 45
      }
    ]
  },
